    "body_html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Ethnic Brand Two-Piece Lawn Allover Suit</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Brand: Ethnic</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Fabric: Premium Quality Lawn</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Outfit Type: Two-Piece Unstitched Suit (Shirt & Dupatta / Trouser combination)</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Design Pattern: Allover Print</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Cutting/Meterage: 3.5 Guz (Yards) per suit cut</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Product Description</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Elevate your everyday style with this exquisite two-piece unstitched lawn outfit from Ethnic. Crafted from premium breathable lawn fabric, this suit features an intricate allover print designed to give a seamless, elegant look from front to back. With a generous 3.5 guz cutting, it provides ample fabric for customized tailoring to suit your preferred silhouette and styling needs. Perfect for casual wear and warm-weather comfort, combining traditional charm with contemporary aesthetics.</p>",
