    "body_html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Step into the new season with this elegant digital linen viscose ensemble from Zesh, blending delicate floral prints with modern, flowing silhouettes designed for cooler weather.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Product Details</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Brand: Zesh</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Collection: Winter/Fall Series '26</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Fabric: Digital Linen Viscose</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Shirt: Deep-toned base featuring intricate, all-over light floral prints. The showcased styling features an asymmetrical peplum hem, tiered bell sleeves, and a side-tie cord with tassels.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Dupatta: Matching flowing drape featuring a striking geometric chevron pattern.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Trouser: Solid dark fabric designed to beautifully complement the printed shirt, ideal for wide-leg or palazzo tailoring.</p>",
    "description": "Step into the new season with this elegant digital linen viscose ensemble from Zesh, blending delicate floral prints with modern, flowing silhouettes designed for cooler weather.\n\nProduct Details\nBrand: Zesh\n\nCollection: Winter/Fall Series '26\nFabric: Digital Linen Viscose\nShirt: Deep-toned base featuring intricate, all-over light floral prints. The showcased styling features an asymmetrical peplum hem, tiered bell sleeves, and a side-tie cord with tassels.\nDupatta: Matching flowing drape featuring a striking geometric chevron pattern.\nTrouser: Solid dark fabric designed to beautifully complement the printed shirt, ideal for wide-leg or palazzo tailoring.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-11T18:50:40.441Z"
  },
