    "body_html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Discover refined elegance with this rich maroon 3-piece unstitched ensemble from Saya, blending traditional charm with cozy winter fabric textures.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Outfit Details</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Shirt: 1.75-meter premium printed khaddar shirt (wider width) featuring intricate floral and ornamental patterns.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Dupatta: 2.5-meter premium printed khaddar dupatta with a beautifully detailed border design.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Trouser: 1.75-meter premium dyed khaddar trouser in a matching maroon shade.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Care Instructions: Dry clean recommended; do not use bleach or stain-removing chemicals. Soak fabric in water before stitching, and wash/soak colored and white fabrics separately.</p>",
    "description": "Discover refined elegance with this rich maroon 3-piece unstitched ensemble from Saya, blending traditional charm with cozy winter fabric textures.\n\nOutfit Details\n\nShirt: 1.75-meter premium printed khaddar shirt (wider width) featuring intricate floral and ornamental patterns.\n\nDupatta: 2.5-meter premium printed khaddar dupatta with a beautifully detailed border design.\n\nTrouser: 1.75-meter premium dyed khaddar trouser in a matching maroon shade.\n\nCare Instructions: Dry clean recommended; do not use bleach or stain-removing chemicals. Soak fabric in water before stitching, and wash/soak colored and white fabrics separately.",
